	// `too_many_fields`, `not_allowed`, `invalid_time_zone`, `invalid_date`,
	// `ends_before_starts`, `after_deadline`, `before_deadline`, `duplicate_in_file` or
	// `venue_removed`. The automatic import (`VenueSyncReject`) adds `deadline_tbd`,
